# Portfolio Design

Follow `docs/PRD.md` visual language. Personality: premium, minimal, modern, confident, elegant, intelligent, clean, purposeful.

## Inspired by (not copied)

Apple, Linear, Stripe, Figma, Notion, Vercel — clarity, typography, whitespace, refinement.

## Do

- Minimal palette, strong type, large whitespace, clean grids
- Subtle, purposeful motion only
- High-quality mockups that support the story

## Don't

- Overly decorative or trendy effects
- Unnecessary glow, pill clusters, or visual noise
- Letting UI spectacle outrank product narrative
